# AquaFlow domain

## Invariants

- Customer balance = `sum(utang) − sum(payments)`. CLEAR when `<= 0`.
- Completing a delivery: set status Completed; adjust `inventory.full` / `empty`; update `customer.gallonsOut`.
- Payment modes on complete: `Cash` | `GCash` | `Utang` (Utang creates an utang row, unpaid).
- Delivery statuses: `Pending` | `In Progress` | `Completed` | `Cancelled`.
- Persist under versioned key `aquaFlow_v1`; migrate if schema changes.
- Deleting a customer must also remove their deliveries, utang, and payments.
- Dashboard KPIs must not show the same metric twice (no duplicate utang cards).

## Locale

- Money formatting: `en-PH` with currency from settings (default `₱`).
- Keep bilingual empty-state copy from the HTML app unless an i18n phase says otherwise.
